    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>8</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to"
