  "solution": {
    "text": "In given equation substituting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> by <math><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, we get,<br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br />From these two equations, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">